{"4746930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gaelco Sports Collection (QUByte Classics)", "steam_appid": 4746930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load up your coins and press START!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate 90s arcade rush. This collection brings back 5 legendary, lightning-fast hits developed by the arcade masters at Gaelco. Forget complex simulations; here, it’s all about raw reflexes, immediate fun, and high-speed challenges that defined a generation of cabinet gaming.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive at breakneck speeds in the cult-classic isometric racers World Rally Championship and World Rally 2, where every corner requires perfect drifts against a brutal 60-second timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer treacherous slopes in Snowboard Championship, execute precise racket strikes in Squash, and dominate the sand with fierce smashes in Touch and Go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a pure dopamine rush straight from the golden age of arcades.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Arcade Icons in 1 Pack: Play the complete World Rally duology, Snowboard Championship, Touch and Go, and Squash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Isometric Racing Perfection: Drift through mud, tarmac, and snow, navigate night stages, and outrun the clock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenetic Multiplayer Challenges: Challenge a friend in local split-screen or alternate turns to see who rules the cabinet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Enhancements: Save your progress at any time with Save States and customize your visual experience with classic CRT screen filters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Retro Gallery: Explore original game manuals, historic concept art, and promotional materials straight from the vaults.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load up your coins and press START!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate 90s arcade rush. This collection brings back 5 legendary, lightning-fast hits developed by the arcade masters at Gaelco. Forget complex simulations; here, it’s all about raw reflexes, immediate fun, and high-speed challenges that defined a generation of cabinet gaming.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive at breakneck speeds in the cult-classic isometric racers World Rally Championship and World Rally 2, where every corner requires perfect drifts against a brutal 60-second timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer treacherous slopes in Snowboard Championship, execute precise racket strikes in Squash, and dominate the sand with fierce smashes in Touch and Go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a pure dopamine rush straight from the golden age of arcades.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Arcade Icons in 1 Pack: Play the complete World Rally duology, Snowboard Championship, Touch and Go, and Squash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Isometric Racing Perfection: Drift through mud, tarmac, and snow, navigate night stages, and outrun the clock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenetic Multiplayer Challenges: Challenge a friend in local split-screen or alternate turns to see who rules the cabinet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Enhancements: Save your progress at any time with Save States and customize your visual experience with classic CRT screen filters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Retro Gallery: Explore original game manuals, historic concept art, and promotional materials straight from the vaults.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Master the acclaimed high-speed races of World Rally 1 and 2, fly across the snow in style